cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reuse its reproduction harness, please cite it as below."
title: "AutoResearch Lite: a reproducible paper-inspired experiment runner (Adam mechanism reproduction and convergence-speed comparison)"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free experiment runner that turns a paper's research question into a
  configuration-driven, verifiable experiment task. The bundled reproduction implements
  the first/second moment estimates and bias correction of Adam (Kingma & Ba, 2014) and
  compares them with a fixed-learning-rate SGD baseline under a fixed seed, plus a
  one-command entry point and an expected-values verifier.
